From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:43:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nb/intel/haswell/native_raminit: A diagnostic of the margins
 after power-up

Not for a release. On a ThinkPad W541 a training right after a power
cycle reset or a boot from S5 has the read margins of channel 1
narrower than one after a warm reset (7 of 7 against 12 of 12).

HASWELL_NRI_POWERUP_DIAG: in every boot that trains, measure the
margins again after 3 s and after a ZQ calibration of the DIMMs, then
train a second time with the optimisations, and log the four sets
together at the end.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I2bda9178ea7cbd30faa5861701181fe7f14e9128
---
